Required attribution statement (verbatim, per the licence):

  Salvage Union is copyrighted by Leyline Press. Salvage Union and the
  'Powered by Salvage' logo are used with permission of Leyline Press,
  under the Salvage Union Open Game Licence 1.0b.

Key terms (summary — the full licence text at the URL above is authoritative):
- Grants worldwide, royalty-free, non-exclusive rights to create derivative
  tabletop RPG material for Salvage Union.
- Direct copying of text is permitted for reference citations and Virtual
  Tabletop implementations; otherwise content must be adapted.
- Artwork from published Salvage Union materials is NOT covered by this
  licence. Artwork on salvageunion.io is used with separate special
  permission from Leyline Press and may not be redistributed.
- Applies to tabletop RPG books and VTT content only (not film, TV, novels,
  comics, or video games).
- Leyline Press retains all copyright and trademark rights.

